# A recursive driver loops, accumulating, until a condition completes it.
>>> {"op":"eval","code":"val r2 = embedRepl[Int] { (ctx, s) => def go(i: Int): Nothing = if (i >= 3) s.complete(i) else { s.eval(s\"val step$i = $i\"); go(i + 1) }; go(0) }"}
~ "ok":true.*val r2: Int = 3
